# --- Vivado / Zynq (Arty Z7-10): no versionar artefactos regenerables ---
# Si conviene versionar: .xpr, .bd, .xci, fuentes (.vhd/.v/.sv), .xdc, Tcl de recreate

# --- Vivado: artefactos de sesion ---
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.debug
*.tmp
*.dmp
*.lso
webtalk*.xml
webtalk*.jou
webtalk*.log
usage_statistics*
vivado*.backup.*
hs_err_pid*

# --- Directorios que Vivado regenera ---
.Xil/
*.cache/
*.runs/
*.sim/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.gen/
*.cache
*.runs
*.sim
*.hw

# --- Block Design: IP generado (se regenera desde el .bd) ---
**/bd/*/ip/
**/bd/*/ipshared/
**/bd/*/hw_handoff/
**/bd/*/synth/
**/bd/*/sim/
**/bd/*/hdl/
**/bd/*/*.bda
**/bd/*/*.hwdef
**/bd/*/*.bxml

